WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
Start with the project basics: choose the service, location, stage and approximate size.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:18.000
State the expected output, available records, preferred timing and site-access information.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:29.000
Explain what the survey will support, then add your name and WhatsApp number.

00:00:29.000 --> 00:00:40.000
Review the generated project brief before opening WhatsApp.

00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:50.000
Attach relevant plans, title documents, drawings or site photographs, then send.
